exports[`shows an embeddable project list with the explicit demonstration boundary 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/sample.png"/><section class="drama-workbench" aria-label="AI 短剧工作台"><div class="drama-main"><header class="drama-topbar"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="AI 短剧路径"><button>AI 短剧</button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>我的项目</span></nav><div class="topbar-actions"><span class="preview-tag"><span></span>页面预览</span><button class="button secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-settings2"><path d="M20 7h-9"></path><path d="M14 17H5"></path><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3"></circle></svg>生成服务设置</button></div></header><div class="preview-strip"><span>演示数据 · 操作只预览页面变化，不调用生图服务</span><span>本次编辑仅在当前页面保留</span></div><div class="drama-content"><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>短剧工作台</h1><p>从一个故事开始，逐步整理需求、画面与创作成果。</p></div><button class="button primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>新建项目</button></div><p class="detail-note">所有用户可用；生成消耗个人独立积分。当前为页面演示，不实际扣费。</p><div class="section-row"><div class="filter-tabs"><button class="active">我的项目 <small>3</small></button><button class="">已归档</button></div><label class="search-field"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input aria-label="搜索项目名称" placeholder="搜索项目名称" value=""/></label></div><div class="project-grid"><button class="project-card"><div class="project-card-photo project-tone-0"><img src="/sample.png" alt="窗边茶壶的 Krea2 测试样例"/><span class="cover-label">都市情感</span></div><div class="project-card-text"><h2>窗边的来信<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" style="transform:rotate(-45deg)"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></h2><p>一间旧茶室，一封迟到的信，一次与过去的重逢。</p><div class="project-card-meta"><span>需求 v2</span><span>概念图 v2 已选用</span></div><small>刚刚编辑</small></div></button><button class="project-card"><div class="project-card-photo project-tone-1"><div class="project-art-placeholder"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-film"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 3v18"></path><path d="M3 7.5h4"></path><path d="M3 12h18"></path><path d="M3 16.5h4"></path><path d="M17 3v18"></path><path d="M17 7.5h4"></path><path d="M17 16.5h4"></path></svg><span>故事正在开始</span></div><span class="cover-label">东方奇幻</span></div><div class="project-card-text"><h2>山海旧事<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" style="transform:rotate(-45deg)"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></h2><p>少年在旧地图上发现一座不存在的城。</p><div class="project-card-meta"><span>需求 v1</span><span>待完善画面</span></div><small>昨天编辑</small></div></button><button class="project-card"><div class="project-card-photo project-tone-2"><div class="project-art-placeholder"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-film"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 3v18"></path><path d="M3 7.5h4"></path><path d="M3 12h18"></path><path d="M3 16.5h4"></path><path d="M17 3v18"></path><path d="M17 7.5h4"></path><path d="M17 16.5h4"></path></svg><span>概念图待查看</span></div><span class="cover-label">城市故事</span></div><div class="project-card-text"><h2>最后一班车<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" style="transform:rotate(-45deg)"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></h2><p>夜班司机与一位不愿说出目的地的乘客。</p><div class="project-card-meta"><span>需求 v1</span><span><span class="status-dot busy"></span>概念图 v1 · 排队中</span></div><small>3 天前编辑</small></div></button></div></div></div><dialog class="modal" aria-labelledby="drama-modal-title"><div class="modal-header"><h2 id="drama-modal-title">生成服务设置</h2><button class="button icon" aria-label="关闭弹窗"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div></dialog></section>"`;
